**Holiday Policy – Acme Corporation**

| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| **Public Holidays** | The company observes **12 official public holidays** each calendar year. The full holiday calendar is published by HR at the start of the year. |
| **Compensatory Leave** | If you’re scheduled to work on a public holiday, you’re eligible for **compensatory (make‑up) leave**. Just let your manager know and the HR portal will handle the paperwork. |
| **Annual Paid Leave** | Full‑time employees receive **20 days of paid annual leave** per calendar year. |
| **Advance Notice** | Submit leave requests through the HR portal **at least 5 working days** before the intended start date. |
| **Carry‑over** | Unused annual leave can be carried forward **up to a maximum of 5 days** into the next year. |
| **Sick Leave** | Separate from annual leave: **10 paid sick days** per year. A medical certificate is required for sick leave longer than 2 consecutive days. |

**Quick Tips**

- **Plan Ahead**: Check the holiday calendar early and book your time off through the portal.
- **Compensatory Leave**: If you’re working on a holiday, just request the make‑up day in the portal—no extra paperwork needed.
- **Carry‑over**: If you have more than 5 days left at year‑end, you’ll need to use them or discuss a rollover with HR.

If you have any more questions—like how to request a holiday or what happens if you’re on a public holiday—just let me know! 🌞
